[TITLE]
IO-52: [EVENTS] with RULE_STEP 60 s and a fixed 45 s ROUTING_STEP. Between
events the fixed step skips the rule grid, and when the event at 3:00 starts
5.2.4 and 5.3.0 compute a zero routing step and stop with error 107 (BND-10).

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             06:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         45
RULE_STEP            00:01:00
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00
VARIABLE_STEP        0

[JUNCTIONS]
J1   100   10   2   0   0
J2   99    10   0   0   0

[OUTFALLS]
O1   97   FREE   NO

[ORIFICES]
OR1  J1  J2  SIDE  0  0.65  NO  0

[CONDUITS]
C1   J2   O1   400   0.013   0   0   0   0

[XSECTIONS]
OR1  RECT_CLOSED  1.0  1.0  0  0
C1   CIRCULAR   1.5   0   0   0   1

[INFLOWS]
J1   FLOW   ""   FLOW   1.0   1.0   2.0

[CONTROLS]
RULE R1
IF SIMULATION TIME > 1
THEN ORIFICE OR1 SETTING = 0.2
ELSE ORIFICE OR1 SETTING = 1.0

[EVENTS]
01/01/2020 03:00 01/01/2020 05:00

[REPORT]
INPUT NO
CONTROLS YES
LINKS OR1
